Tanks located above ground, inside or outside of buildings, shall comply with any one of the following design standards, as appropriate for the specific installation as determined by the engineer:

 1. UL 80; such tanks shall be listed and labeled;

 2. UL 142; such tanks shall be listed and labeled;

 3. UL 2258; such tanks shall be installed only in one- or two-family dwellings in accordance with Section 1305.15 and shall be listed and labeled; 

 4. ASME Boiler and Pressure Vessel Code , Section VIII, Division 1 or 2; such tanks shall be labeled; or

 5. Alternate tank design and construction standards contained in Section 1305.14 

 (Am. L.L. 2023/077, 6/11/2023, eff. 6/11/2023) 

 Editor's note: For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at L.L. 2023/077 .
